{"config":{"election_day":"2026-10-27","results_url":"https://media26.bechirot.gov.il/files/expb.csv","results_url_localities":"https://media26.bechirot.gov.il/files/expc.csv","drill_url":"https://media25.bechirot.gov.il/files/expb.csv","station_turnout_url":null,"eligible":7331981,"github_feed":true,"publish_every_min":10,"lean_during_voting":false,"projection_paused":false,"pause_reason":"","envelopes_expected":null,"ignore_columns":[],"column_aliases":{},"mixed_area_class":false,"notes":{"eligible":"The CEC's register size for the 26th Knesset: 7,331,981 (reported 21.10.2026 by mako and ynet 'according to the Central Elections Committee'; 6,788,804 in 2022 plus the 543,177 added since). Read every pass: an edit acts within a minute; on the night the feed reports 'register exceeded' if the counted בזב passes it.","ignore_columns":"Election-night fix for an unexpected column in the 2026 file: header names to treat as metadata, e.g. [\"סהכ\"]. The reader already ignores any header that is not 1-4 Hebrew letters, a column that is mostly not numbers, and one extra numeric column that explains a sum mismatch; checks.ignored_columns in results.json lists what was dropped.","column_aliases":"Election-day fix for renamed headers: {\"their name\": \"expected name\"}, e.g. {\"מס' קלפי\": \"קלפי\"}. Read by both the results file (expb.csv) and the per-station turnout file (station_turnout_url). Expected: סמל ישוב, שם ישוב, קלפי (or מספר קלפי), בזב, מצביעים, פסולים, כשרים. The yod spellings סמל יישוב / שם יישוב and בעלי זכות בחירה are already accepted; the turnout reader also takes קוד ישוב, מס' קלפי, הצביעו, מספר מצביעים and אחוז הצבעה (with בזב).","results_url":"Same path as 2019–2022 (media2X.bechirot.gov.il/files/expb.csv). On 9.10.2026 it answered 404 to GitHub's runners while a third party saw a placeholder file from other networks (5.10): the files may not be up yet, or GitHub's cloud addresses may be blocked. Nothing is fetched from it before 27.10 22:00 Israel time; until then it is only probed (status.results_probe).","drill_url":"The 2022 file used by a rehearsal (falls back to data/official/k25_expb.csv).","station_turnout_url":"Set to the CEC per-station turnout file once its address is known. Status: chair's decision of 16.8.2026 (at least four publications per regular polling station); the High Court (בג״ץ 60697-08-26, 17.9.2026) vacated the plenum's 6.9 decision and left the ban on identified reporting; per Walla, JNS and Channel 12 (every four hours) the aggregate per-station publication stands. As of 9.10 no times, URL or format were published. A path in the repository (e.g. live_input/stations.csv, a copy the operator committed) is read the same way. Each new release (a new file) feeds the sector turnout and the Arab-society section; its time is sectors_time in live_input/turnout.json, set for every release before its file arrives (it labels only the file it was set for). While the polls are open a new file without its own time is held up to 10 minutes, then labelled with the time it was first seen (22:00 if after the polls close). Comma, semicolon, tab or | separated; a blank, '-' or 0 figure is a station not reported yet.","github_feed":"Set to false to stop the GitHub Actions loop (it re-reads this file every pass) so a laptop or self-hosted run can take over without touching repository settings.","publish_every_min":"Branch mode (Pages deploys from main, the current setting): the feed commits site/live/ to main and asks Pages for a build at most once every this many minutes (1-60), because branch builds have a soft limit of 10 an hour and every push to main (the operator's too) is a build. The first results file and the first exit polls after 22:00 go out at once. A change in timestamps alone is published every 30 minutes (or twice this, if longer; 60 from 28.10 12:00), and status.json heartbeat_s is that gap. Recommended: 10, set in the same push as eligible (docs/ELECTION_DAY.md הכנות 2): the hour after 22:00 is the busiest. Ignored in Actions mode (no build limit there).","lean_during_voting":"The 2022-vote-weighted turnout pace by bloc is published during voting hours only when true (pending the CEC legal adviser); after 22:00 always.","projection_paused":"Set to true to stop showing the projection (the count is still shown), e.g. if the CEC file looks inconsistent; pause_reason is shown on the page. Acts at the next pass on the last accepted file, even while the CEC file is unchanged or rejected, and after a run hand-off (a new workflow run has no copy of that file) on the published results.json.","mixed_area_class":"Off by default. When true, a station of a mixed city (Haifa, Jaffa, Lod, Ramla, Akko, Jerusalem, Nof HaGalil, Ma'alot-Tarshiha, Safed, Neve Shalom) under a number that was not a 2022 station group, which today is left out of the Arab section as 'unclassified', takes the class of its 2026 statistical area from the CBS station file (pipeline/reference/cbs_stations_2026.json): with an Arab share of half or more it counts in the city's Arab stations (turnout; in pace it is a new station) and in the day's 'mixed' sector; below half it is left out as a non-Arab station; a number not in the CBS file stays unclassified. Turnout only, as the rest of the section. Off, the section reports in arab.checks the stations it would class (unclassified_area_arab, unclassified_area_other), so the effect can be read on the night before switching. Evidence (build_cbs_stations.py --analog, six past pairs): better F1 in 5 and a smaller turnout error of the Arab set in 4, but worse by 0.0014 in K25->K24, the pair that runs like the live code; hence off. Read every pass.","envelopes_expected":"Valid votes expected in double envelopes. Set ONLY from an official CEC statement (acting DG Dean Livne reportedly expects 600–700k envelopes; 2022 had 462,807 voters, 458,714 valid); otherwise it is estimated from 2022 and the count is never marked complete. Acts at the next pass, like projection_paused, except after a run hand-off while the CEC file cannot be read: then status.errors says 'not applied yet' until the file is read again."}},"turnout_input":{"national":{},"released":{},"source":"","source_url":""},"source":["K25","drill"],"drill_source":"https://media25.bechirot.gov.il/files/expb.csv","drill_start":1792577870.2785301,"drill_fraction":0.278,"probe":{"http":404,"at_he":"13:28","ts":1792578488.652339},"exit_input":null,"drill":true,"rows":2082,"sha256":"4dd33434161af92d005b98de4cf4674e82b4e45cc5a970fdfa35a62408b2ae20","at":"2026-10-21T13:29:01.738703+03:00","data_he":"13:29","counted":0.1767,"stations":["1020:1","1020:11","1020:17.2","1020:17.3","1020:17.6","1020:23","1020:24.4","1020:4.1","1020:9","1034:1","1034:10","1034:11","1034:12.1","1034:12.3","1034:12.4","1034:12.5","1034:14","1034:15","1034:16","1034:19","1034:21","1034:22","1034:24.1","1034:24.2","1034:24.3","1034:24.4","1034:24.5","1034:3","1034:5","1034:6","1034:7","1034:8.2","1034:8.3","1034:8.5","1034:9","1034:950","1046:1","104:1.1","104:1.2","1054:1.1","1054:1.3","1054:16.1","1054:2","1054:3","1054:7","1054:9.1","1054:9.2","1061:1.1","1061:10","1061:11","1061:15","1061:17.1","1061:17.2","1061:17.3","1061:17.4","1061:18","1061:19","1061:20","1061:21.1","1061:21.2","1061:21.3","1061:21.4","1061:23","1061:25.2","1061:26","1061:27","1061:28.1","1061:28.2","1061:28.3","1061:28.4","1061:33","1061:35.1","1061:35.2","1061:38.1","1061:38.2","1061:4.1","1061:4.2","1061:4.3","1061:42","1061:43","1061:47.1","1061:47.2","1061:47.3","1061:47.4","1061:48","1061:5.2","1061:50.1","1061:50.2","1061:52","1061:56","1061:57","1061:58.1","1061:6.1","1061:6.2","1061:60.1","1061:60.2","1061:70","1061:71.1","1061:71.2","1061:72","1061:73","1061:74","1061:75","1061:76","1061:8.1","1061:8.2","1061:8.4","1063:10","1063:12","1063:13","1063:18.1","1063:19.1","1063:19.2","1063:20","1063:22","1063:25.1","1063:25.2","1063:26.1","1063:26.2","1063:28","1063:31","1063:32.1","1063:33","1063:4","1063:5","1063:7.1